  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "cell_index": 1,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "缩聚",
      "text_sha256": "92C5424F092CEB53F93D00D6614FCEE0A7D46C0626BC1E2BF1F11827BE36A985",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[1]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 1,
      "kind": "code",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "style": "code",
      "text": "index1 = [1,2];\nindex2 = [3,4,5];\nK2 = KRren;\nK2(index1,index1) = KRren(index1,index1)-KPren;\nK2(index2,index2) = KRren(index2,index2)-KNren;\nC2 = CRren;\nC2(index1,index1) = CRren(index1,index1)-CPren;\nC2(index2,index2) = CRren(index2,index2)-CNren;\nC1 = CRren-C2;\nK1 = KRren-K2;\n\ndt = 1/1024;\nal = (4*MRren+2*dt*CRren+dt^2*KRren)\\MRren*4;\nal = diag(diag(al));",
      "text_sha256": "52DEA49E770CFEE0EE1659EBA23E96D4F5AEBBEB2AAF0EC4DA5B2220CC78A7FF",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[2]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 2,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "\\frac{X\\left(z\\right)}{F\\left(z\\right)}=\\frac{1}{\\frac{{\\left(z-1\\right)}^2 }{\\alpha z\\Delta t^2 }M+\\frac{z-1}{z\\Delta t}C_1 +{\\mathrm{K}}_1 +z^{-j} \\left(\\frac{z-1}{z\\Delta t}C_2 +{\\mathrm{K}}_2 \\right)}",
      "text_sha256": "1D75124C33541F352B7F523ECDFFC4619B9537F85C02CFBD152AFC174D7F9A11",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[3]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 3,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "按照上述公式计算传递函数",
      "text_sha256": "2DE48E6C7EBCE8E9674178E8867BE5525F78B1C131C4D607603034B85BBF28A2",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[4]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 2,
      "kind": "code",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "style": "code",
      "text": "% 2. 选择矩阵 S: 6x15\nS = zeros(2, 5);\n\n% 定义映射：小矩阵第1-3行 → 大矩阵第1-3行\n% 小矩阵第4-6行 → 大矩阵第6-8行\nrow_map = [1 2];\n\nfor i = 1:2\n    S(i, row_map(i)) = 1;\nend\n\nM = MPren;\nC = CPren;\nK = KPren;\nn = length(M);\n% 系统矩阵\nA = [zeros(n) eye(n); -M\\K -M\\C];\nB = [zeros(n); M\\eye(n)];\n\n% 连续系统 -> 离散\nsys_c = ss(A, B, eye(2*n), zeros(2*n, n));\ndt = 1/1024;  % 离散化周期\nsys_d = c2d(sys_c, dt);\nAd = sys_d.A;\nBd = sys_d.B;\n\nQ = diag([4e8, 1e4, 1e2, 1e1]);\nR = diag([3e-3,1e-2]);\n[K_lqr, ~, ~] = dlqr(Ad, Bd, Q, R);\n% 闭环系统矩阵\nAcl = Ad - Bd * K_lqr;\n\n% 分解增益为刚度、阻尼反馈\nDeltaK = diag(diag(MPren*K_lqr(:, 1:n)))\nDeltaC = diag(diag(MPren*K_lqr(:, n+1:end)));\n\nDeltaG = (z-1)/z/dt*DeltaC+DeltaK;\n\n%for l = 1:20\n%    for j = 1:30",
      "text_sha256": "F5A6FA7A15FDEC67B896530CE2B281C506EA03DD99B4AF9E760C951BA454A2C3",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[5]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 4,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "这里不采用之前的阻尼矩阵进行缩聚，而是采用使用缩聚后的刚度和阻尼矩阵求出新的阻尼",
      "text_sha256": "6EDAA2DC4559EC4FCC9D9296D5FF2E8391A46BB187D4F7607A57B92558D3E4FE",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[6]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 5,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "实际测试表明两者没有区别，虽然矩阵数值上存在差距，但是稳定域没差别",
      "text_sha256": "E2B5ACE1F26382F8215930B73F8CC7B98C97E3976E40E3E99FFEAC3B30969DF1",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[7]"
    },
    {
