    {
      "cell_index": 3,
      "kind": "code",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "style": "code",
      "text": "stab = zeros(20);\n%for l = 0:15\n%l =5;\nfor j = 0:15\n%j = 25;\nl = 0;\n%j = 0;\n%z=tf('z',dt);\nsyms z\n%l = 19;\n%j = 5;\nH = sym(eye(5));\nH(1,1) = z^(-l);\nH(2,2) = z^(-j);\n\n%syms z\nG = (z-1)^2/z/dt^2*MRren/al+(z-1)/z/dt*C1+K1+...\n    ((z-1)/z/dt*C2+K2)*H;\n%+S'*DeltaG*S\n%G = (z-1)^2/z/dt^2*MNren/al+(z-1)/z/dt*CNren+KNren+...\n%    S'*H*((z-1)/z/dt*CPren+KPren+(z-1)/z/dt*Kd_ctrl+Kp_ctrl)*S;\ndet_G = det(G);\nGcls_zero = vpa(solve(det_G == 0, z));\ns = max(abs(Gcls_zero))\nstab(l+1,j+1) = s;\nend\n%end",
      "text_sha256": "759BC0E53F20987098F6E57729A2B1C2B305C2F8D951D3D6EEDCF21B9B8D9FC5",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[9]"
    }
